  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO - Global Education Monitoring Report (GEM Report) - Global</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFAT relies on accurate and globally comparable data to ensure its investments in education are responsive and achieving real results in partner countries, and to support strategic engagement in regional and global policy dialogue. The GEM Report complements other DFAT investments to: improve the collection and analysis of data (including learning assessment data) in the Indo-Pacific; and strengthen Education Management Information Systems (EMIS) in the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
